{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269uGd0uiaaG1795674295.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美聯物業西九龍首席區域營業董事張曉盈表示，該行新近促成長沙灣泓景臺二期8座低層H室的二手成交，單位實用面積約477平方呎，屬2房間隔，買家以約780萬元承接，實用呎價約16,352元。</p><p><br/>張曉盈補充，買家心儀屋苑鄰近港鐵荔枝角站、設有基座商場，生活便利，加上單位方正實用，故決定承接。資料顯示，原業主於2020年9月以約810萬元購入上述單位，持貨約6年，是次轉手帳面虧蝕約30萬元，或約3.7%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:38:07.543455+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:42.384190+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:31:27.412993+00:00","content_hash":"c28e2e9cc26260b68592c6634625a28cf02cfc7e40bf050be3d0e069e7142a21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}